let __v_149 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"There is somewhere to go, and it is arranged through the abuse line rather than looked up tonight: 0808 2000 247 in the UK (1-800-799-7233 in the US) will say what is free near you, and refuges keep their addresses off the open internet for the obvious reason. Take your keys, your phone, any medication, and whatever papers you can reach.\",\"Refuges exist for exactly this, and the abuse line (0808 2000 247 in the UK, 1-800-799-7233 in the US) knows which ones have space tonight - that is the thing it does all day, and it does not need you to have decided anything. If getting to a phone is not safe, one person you trust is enough of a start.\"]}")?;
